// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1992215085" "Detectives have found a missing scientist who claims the {VillainGroup} forced him to work on {ITEM_NAME} for them."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P842643060" "All units, we're reporting a theft of {ITEM_NAME} by members of the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P768386382" "All units: Canceling APB on renegade scientists. Subjects were under mental control by members of the {VillainGroup} to work on {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2975167611" "Computer Hackers hired by the {VillainGroup} have stolen information on {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3150320902" "Witnesses Reporting that members of the {VillainGroup} were after {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3817828758" "Security guards are reporting a break-in at Portal Corporation offices by members of the {VillainGroup}. Perpetrators escaped with {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1958839126" "Dispatcher to all units: Neighborhood Watch reports of a new cell of the {VillainGroup} matches the probable destination of {ITEM_NAME} that was recently stolen."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2157110248" "An attack by members of the {VillainGroup} on a SERAPH transport has stolen {ITEM_NAME} and evaded pursuit. Subjects are considered dangerous. Approach with caution."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P786847006" "All units be on the alert for members of the {VillainGroup} carrying stolen {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3515395439" "We've received an ultimatum from members of the {VillainGroup}. They claim that they have {ITEM_NAME} and will use it unless one of they're leaders is freed from the Zigg"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2677620888" "Detectives report a note left behind by the members of the {VillainGroup} who carried out the theft of {ITEM_NAME} claims that society is to blame."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1209732340" "All units, all units: Dr. Sheridan has reported {ITEM_NAME} missing. He reports this may become a scientific emergency."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2656395754" "We have a report that {ITEM_NAME} has been Hijacked from the docks by members of the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3280470294" "Be on alert: {VillainGroup} agents have stolen {ITEM_NAME} from the 'Famous Villain Technology' Display at the museum."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P302650374" "Reporting an assault on a DATA field team by members of the {VillainGroup}. Attackers escaped with {ITEM_NAME}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_1 Var Name - INTRODUCTION_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3804533463" "It's good that the police have rescued that scientist, but the after-effects might be out of their league. Getting {ITEM_NAME} away from the {VillainGroup} is something you can handle, though."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P389651692" "The {VillainGroup} have struck again, this time stealing {ITEM_NAME}. If they have access to that, it could be bad for the whole city."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2653170380" "Mind controlling scientists? You didn't even know that the {VillainGroup} could do that! This might be a good time to step in and get the {ITEM_NAME} they were forced to work on away from the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1060684058" "So, the {VillainGroup} hired computer hackers to do their dirty work. That would explain rumors that they'd been stealing computer equipment. Fortunately, you've heard where the group masterminding this plan are."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P838294477" "If those witnesses were correct, the results of {ITEM_NAME} in the hands of the {VillainGroup} could be bad for the whole city. This might be a good case to investigate yourself."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P883464479" "Portal Corporation works on a lot of strange things like {ITEM_NAME}, and it makes them a big target for groups like the {VillainGroup}. That's something you just can't allow to happen."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1719725266" "Sometimes the most vigilant guardians of the city are it's citizens themselves. And if they've found where the {VillainGroup} have hidden {ITEM_NAME}, all the better."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1576698985" "You'd heard that a group of the {VillainGroup} were planning a big raid to steal something like that. Fortunately, you had your contacts locate their hide-out, just in case."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1403476351" "Members of the {VillainGroup} with stolen {ITEM_NAME}? You'd heard about that earlier today. Might be a good thing to investigate."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1042276864" "An ultimatum from the {VillainGroup}? And they plan to use {ITEM_NAME} to carry out their threat? They might be bluffing, but it could also be a good idea to make sure this doesn't go any further."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P564194358" "Members of the {VillainGroup} who blame society? Wait a second... You know which cell of the {VillainGroup} that was. {ITEM_NAME} may even still be there."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3540222707" "If Dr. Sheridan is worried, this might be bad. As you think about it, weren't some members of the {VillainGroup} talking about sneaking into his lab? This might be worth your time to investigate."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2583626443" "You'd heard that members of the {VillainGroup} were seen casing the docks. This could fit the pattern. Time to act."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2202711732" "You'd known from the beginning that a display of villain technology would only be trouble, but there's no time for pointing fingers and placing blame. You've got to get {ITEM_NAME} back from the {VillainGroup} before it's too late."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2502022967" "While it's worrisome that a DATA field team had {ITEM_NAME} on them without proper protection, it's more important to get it back from the {VillainGroup} now."
// Script Variable ACCEPT_STRING :
"P2746391581" "Get {ITEM_NAME} from the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P836415898" "The {VillainGroup} won't have their hands on {ITEM_NAME} for long. Not if you can help it."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2092258681" "You need to get {ITEM_NAME} from the {VillainGroup} before they can use it to hurt people."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P4236029208" "With {ITEM_NAME} in their hands, the {VillainGroup} could be a real threat to the city. You've got to stop them."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2406822510" "You've got to get {ITEM_NAME} away from the {VillainGroup} before it's too late."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2186363507" "Leaving {ITEM_NAME} in the hands of the {VillainGroup} is a recipe for disaster."

