// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Item Var Name - ITEM_DESCRIPTION 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2566047110" "These are blueprints for a spaceship, first designed back in the 1970s. It was designed to reach the moon, but you have to wonder what a group of villains would want to get to the moon for?"
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1875469795" "It may look like a high-tech egg-beater, but this thing is supposed to be able to radically alter people's thought processes. No one's ever gotten it to work right, but the threat of it alone has caused trouble to this city in past."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2189556655" "This is an Oberation Oscillthruster! And they'd thrown it away like a piece of trash. Those villains must not have had any idea what this was. You'd better get this back, and quickly."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P400446125" "These prototype artificial intelligences are dangerous for their ability to be molded. In the wrong hands, they could become free-roaming cyber terrorists, or worse. But thanks to you, they have a chance to become productive members of the electronic world."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3413617823" "It's here, and still deactivated. This bomb uses a strange Rikti power source in an out-of-control reaction to produce an immense amount of damage. Good thing you got to it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2446432407" "The Over-Taking Taking-Over MicroChip Remote Controller, model E; is a self-propelled robot capable of intercepting a vehicle and over-riding it's internal guidance systems. They're very dangerous in the wrong hands, but excellent for handling out of control vehicles."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3588532195" "The all-purpose virus is a cyber-somatic virus, a computer virus with the illogical ability to infect both computers and humans. This sample has been deactivated, but it could be used to create another outbreak."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3956758656" "These files contain accounts of truly extraordinary events. And in a world where super humans fly through the sky, that's saying something. Entire departments in government agencies filled with top men work on this kind of thing. With the knowledge in here, someone unscrupulous could have caused a great deal of trouble."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3875707658" "The Phased Linear Oscillation Transducer is a miraculous device, capable of producing such a variety effects that many find it simply unbelievable. However, overusing a P.L.O.T. device can have serious consequences, and the more egregious uses can strain the very fabric of reality. P.L.O.T. devices have fallen out of favor overall, but many a young and reckless pioneer has picked up a well-used P.L.O.T. device and run with it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P556121039" "Not to be confused with the illegal street drug Superadyne, the Superadigm Seed is a relic of a long-lost alien race known as the Keer-B that was brought to Earth by the Kheldians. It's an artificially constructed pocket universe where the seeds of super powers and heroism were sewn, and then allowed to develop. It's inhabitants fight for justice against the forces of evil, never knowing that their entire cosmos can fit in someone's pocket. It's thought that if the seed could be planted outside the boundaries of the universe, it could grow into a new universe of it's own. In the meantime, numerous rogues have tried to get their hands on it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P347005736" "The Rikti use some kind of telepathy to communicate with their semi-organic technology. Before the Rikti war was over, human scientists were trying to learn how this worked, so that they could copy it or jam it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P673564080" "This alloy of Nonsuchium and Yeahritium is an extraordinary material. It's a good thing that you were able to get it away from the bad guys."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2203023207" "Formula 13 was one of the last of the Cold War attempts to create a super-trooper serum that could turn normal people into super human soldiers. It never worked right, but stolen data from the program helped in the creation of Superadyne."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1574718253" "From the more exotic areas where information technology and beverage engineering overlap comes the Liquid Computer. By utilizing laminar fluid flow and self-assembling nanotech scaffolds, this liquid can perform more calculations than a supercomputer, all in a 2-liter bottle. And it's caffeine free!"
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2379603745" "The Ultrascope! was designed to see things otherwise impossible to view, such as strange energy fields and even the far reaches of space and time."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3089485580" "The Tachyon wave motion prototype is a test model of a new engine design that could theoretically propel a space ship faster than the speed of light. Of course, it could also be turned into a dangerous weapon in the wrong hands."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P389853615" "This densely packed computer core could be used as the AI for a very advanced robot. Some even think that a human consciousness could be uploaded into one."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2569172517" "This unique weapon was created by a Japanese scientist to combat aquatic giant monsters. It's hideous effects caused it to be banned by UN treaty."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1372212275" "These are cells from one of the giant monsters the late hero Talos fought back in the 1960s. No one has been able to unlock their genetic secrets and control the effect of the experiments since, but science continues to try."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P4141651125" "All this trouble over {ITEM_NAME}. When will the forces of evil learn?"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2830031807" "The {VillainGroup} didn't even have any guards posted. They must be consumed with {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P305523873" "Time to bring some justice to this party."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2576161857" "Did they really think they'd get away with stealing {ITEM_NAME} in Paragon City?"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1177570034" "You've got to stop this situation before it gets out of control."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2167146260" "It would be nice if the {VillainGroup} in here surrendered {ITEM_NAME} quietly, but somehow you don't think that's going to happen."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2050552570" "You found the place without too much trouble, thanks to the assistance of helpful citizens."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P712948699" "You can hear sounds of {VillainGroup} activity inside."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1655849160" "All the evidence shows that {ITEM_NAME} must be here. You can only hope you're right."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2990797186" "The forces of evil won't know what hit them."
